OL,3,GNEWSAVital scans missed 'due to        
OL,4,Ashocking post delays'                  
OL,6,FPeople are missing out on crucial      
OL,7,Fcancer scans, medical appointments and 
OL,8,Fimportant bills because of "shocking"  
OL,9,Fpostal delays, an MP has said.         
OL,11,FLabour's Jonathan Brash said some      
OL,12,Fpeople in his area of Hartlepool had   
OL,13,Fgone weeks without a delivery to their 
OL,14,Fhomes and he described Royal Mail's    
OL,15,Fslow service as "a complete and utter" 
OL,16,Fdisaster.                              
OL,18,FHe was one of 70 MPs to question the   
OL,19,Fcompany's chief executive in Parliament
OL,20,Flast week about "persistent failures"  
OL,21,Fwith the service.                      
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
