OL,3,GNEWSAVital scans missed 'due to        
OL,4,Ashocking post delays'                  
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Royal Mail claimed a
OL,7,F"significant improvement" in delivery  
OL,8,Fspeeds across Teesside where 81% of    
OL,9,Ffirst class mail now arrived the next  
OL,10,Fday.                                   
